SUMMARY:The Sade Experience
DESCRIPTION:Shelley Hamilton – vocals\nCarrie Chesnutt – saxopohone\, flute\, vocals\nSean Bray – guitar\nJoe Palawan – keys\, vocals\nRoger Williams – bass\nPaul Antonio – drums \n \nThe Sade Experience is an immersive\, living journey into the heart and soul of a global icon. Created and performed by Shelley Hamilton\, this ensemble delivers the ultimate “quiet storm” experience\, bringing unparalleled depth and presence to the stage – every song curated for pure immersion. \nCOVER: $20
